Telephone catalogue provenance

This catalogue was generated from nyaruka/phonenumbers v1.7.5 supported regions
and country codes, with reviewed display names and literal dial-prefix hints.
It is a transformed catalogue, not an unmodified upstream metadata file.
Original definition bytes are retained; library validation currently uses the
module's independently pinned phonenumbers version.

